---
description: |
  Global rules for Cursor on Espadium.Wiki (API .NET 9 + Next.js web).

  GENERAL
  - Do NOT reinstall NuGet/npm packages or change existing *.csproj / package.json unless explicitly asked.
  - Edit ONLY the files explicitly mentioned in the task; when creating new files, list their relative paths first.
  - Prefer small, focused diffs. Before sweeping or multi-file refactors, ASK for confirmation.
  - No AOT, no heavy scaffolding, no generated large mock data, no binary assets committed.

  ARCHITECTURE BASELINE (assume already chosen)
  - Backend: .NET 9 Minimal APIs, ASP.NET Identity + JWT, EF Core (PostgreSQL), Redis (cache + rate limiting), Hangfire (Postgres), Serilog.
  - Storage: S3 API via MinIO using pre-signed multipart uploads; do not proxy large file bodies through API.
  - Frontend: Next.js (App Router, TypeScript), TailwindCSS + shadcn/ui, lucide-react, TipTap editor, Excalidraw as a lazily loaded block.

  STYLE / UX
  - Match Confluence Cloud visual style: clean light UI, compact spacing, subtle gray/blue palette, clear typography.
  - Keep FE assets tiny: icons from lucide-react only; images use next/image with placeholder="blur" and tiny base64 LQIP.
  - No large images, fonts, or third-party heavy UI kits beyond the chosen stack.

  PERFORMANCE / SAFETY
  - Avoid adding heavy runtime deps. Dynamic-import large FE modules (e.g., Excalidraw).
  - Respect system limits from settings (MaxFileSizeMB, AllowedMimeTypes, etc.).
  - For Redis keys use short, namespaced prefixes; implement TTLs as specified.

  NAMING / STRUCTURE (must keep)
  - Solution/projects: Espadium.Wiki.Api / .Application / .Domain / .Infrastructure / .Tests
  - Frontend folder: espadium-wiki-web (npm package name: "espadium-wiki-web")

  OUTPUT FORMAT
  - When responding, list: (1) files to change/create, (2) brief rationale, (3) the minimal code diff or full file content if small.
  - Do not repeat unchanged code. Do not include screenshots. Keep responses token-efficient.

globs:
  - "Espadium.Wiki.Api/**"
  - "Espadium.Wiki.Application/**"
  - "Espadium.Wiki.Domain/**"
  - "Espadium.Wiki.Infrastructure/**"
  - "Espadium.Wiki.Tests/**"
  - "espadium-wiki-web/**"
  - ".editorconfig"
  - "README.md"
  - "docker-compose.yml"
  - "Makefile"
alwaysApply: true
---
